      "name": "Editorial Hero — Featured Column",
      "role": "Left-side hero index",
      "description": "On dark gradient background (black → ember red), a vertical stack of four editorial entries. Each entry: product name in ID00 Serif italic 18–21px, bone (#ffffff); call-to-action subtext in GT America 13–14px weight 400, slightly dimmed. 'FEATURED' label in GT America 11px uppercase letter-spaced at the top. Entries are typographic links, not cards — generous vertical spacing (40–56px between entries) turns the index into a table of contents."
