      "role": "Catalog product tile",
      "description": "Black or near-black background. Product photograph fills the upper 60–70% of the card on a warm-tinted studio backdrop. Product name in ID00 Serif italic 21–24px bone. Tasting notes in GT America 13–14px #b3b3b3. Price pill anchored bottom-left. Hairline border 1px in #1a1a1a, radius 4px."
